      "name": "网络属性计算",
      "description": "计算 IP 网络的网络地址、广播地址、子网掩码、首/末可用 IP、可用 IP 数、总 IP 数等核心属性，同时支持 BigInteger 与无符号整数互转以及位运算辅助。",
      "evidence": ["src/System.Net.IPNetwork/IPNetwork2Members.cs", "src/System.Net.IPNetwork/IPNetwork2ToIPAddress.cs", "src/System.Net.IPNetwork/IPNetwork2ToUint.cs", "src/System.Net.IPNetwork/IPNetwork2ToCidr.cs", "src/System.Net.IPNetwork/IPNetwork2ToNetmask.cs", "src/System.Net.IPNetwork/IPNetwork2BitsSet.cs", "src/System.Net.IPNetwork/BigIntegerExtensions.cs"]
